# Simple English Translation

## Alice:
Haha.
Yeah. Me too.
I like to play very much.
But I never gamble.
:)

## Bob:
Oh... I never gamble on Big 2 either.
Except for that time a few weeks ago.

## Alice:
What happened a few weeks ago?

## Bob:
I went to a friend's house.
He wanted to play Big 2.
So I said, let's play.
Then he said 1 cent per card... (because he plays very well)
So I thought, "Fine, no big deal"... besides, at most I'd lose something like $10.

## Alice:
So that's how it was.
:)
Hehe. You're really lucky.
It's good actually. But if I really had to gamble, I would not enjoy the game thoroughly.

## Bob:
But it's not very good to "stand so firm" (refuse to gamble)...
Yeah, if you have to gamble, it's very stressful...
By the way, do you have the program?

## Alice:
What program?
No.
Do I need to download it or something?
:)

## Bob:
Well, to play online of course you need a program to play...
My client doesn't support file transfers yet... maybe you can get it from me by FTP or HTTP... wait...

## Alice:
Okay, sure.
:)
Thank you very much.
Hehe [end of text]


